ds  without a ground truth  being invested in this field in the past  year and a half I really encourage you  to experiment and learn about causal  machine learning I believe this way we  can leverage its potential realize its  potential and overall bring the business  value lift we are always looking for  thank you so much for listening I would  be happy to continue this discussion  later  foreign  [Music]

